  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 8.16,
      "e": 11.44,
      "text": "(helicopter blades whirring)"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.44,
      "e": 13.48,
      "text": "- Good morning, Colonel Andy Clark,"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.48,
      "e": 14.9,
      "text": "Ninth Reconnaissance Wing Commander"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.9,
      "e": 17.31,
      "text": "and the Commander of the Beale Air Force Base,"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.31,
      "e": 18.97,
      "text": "out in Northern California."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.97,
      "e": 22.41,
      "text": "Air Force One is here, President Trump just stopped in."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.41,
      "e": 25.21,
      "text": "He's on his way right now up to Chico,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.21,
      "e": 27.69,
      "text": "and the Paradise area to view the Camp Fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.69,
      "e": 29.47,
      "text": "and the damage up there."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.47,
      "e": 31.55,
      "text": "He'll be there for a few hours, take a look around"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.55,
      "e": 33.5,
      "text": "and he's up there with Governor Brown,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.5,
      "e": 36.6,
      "text": "the Lieutenant Governor, the director of FEMA,"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.6,
      "e": 38.57,
      "text": "and on his way back he'll come back through here"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.57,
      "e": 39.4,
      "text": "and then he'll be on his way"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.4,
      "e": 42.02,
      "text": "to check out the fires in Southern California."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.02,
      "e": 43.62,
      "text": "We chatted for a little bit,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.62,
      "e": 45.4,
      "text": "talked about the severity of the fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.4,
      "e": 48.37,
      "text": "and how this is probably the worst fire we've seen,"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.37,
      "e": 50.89,
      "text": "Northern California, from a damage standpoint"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.89,
      "e": 52.72,
      "text": "as well the amount of smoke"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.72,
      "e": 54.69,
      "text": "it's putting into the air with it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.69,
      "e": 56.26,
      "text": "the low air quality we've had"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.26,
      "e": 58.56,
      "text": "and that, and that's about it."
    },
